# Run by supercronic in the `cleanup` container (times are UTC).
# Daily at 03:00: delete expired lists (with links and redirects) and prune rate-limit rows.
# The API already refuses expired lists with 410, so this only reclaims storage.
0 3 * * * python manage.py cleanup_expired
# Daily at 03:20: delete expired sign-in sessions (Django keeps them until removed).
20 3 * * * python manage.py clearsessions
